#: lib/retro_hex_chat/commands/handlers/pin.ex:14
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Keep a message in view for the whole channel — the rules, a link, what was agreed.\nPinned messages are listed in the Pinned window and stay findable after they scroll away.\nOperators only. A channel keeps up to 50."
